--- task
id: t08
dataset: section8
kind: arithmetic

--- intent
List the people whose age doubled is at least `$min`, returning each name, the age times two as `twice`, and 2026 minus the age as `born_about`.

--- params
{"min": 100}

--- edition3
query doubled($min: I32) {
  match { $p: Person  $p.age * 2 >= $min }
  return { $p.name, $p.age * 2 as twice, 2026 - $p.age as born_about }
}
